                            <div class="benefit-card h-100">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-globe text-primary me-2"></i>Works Everywhere</h6>
                                <small>Laptop, server, cloud — same result.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="benefit-card h-100">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-bug text-danger me-2"></i>No "Works On My Machine"</h6>
                                <small>Goodbye, version problems.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="benefit-card h-100">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-warning me-2"></i>Fast</h6>
                                <small>Starts in seconds, not minutes.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="benefit-card h-100">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-compress text-success me-2"></i>Small</h6>
                                <small>Less disk, less RAM, more apps per server.</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="benefit-card h-100">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-copy text-info me-2"></i>Easy to Share</h6>
