                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3"><span class="section-num">4</span> 🔑 Key Docker Words</h3>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table table-bordered align-middle">
                            <thead class="table-light">
                                <tr><th>Word</th><th>Simple Meaning</th></tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td><strong>Image</strong></td><td>A recipe. Instructions to create a container.</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Container</strong></td><td>A running instance of an image. Like a running app.</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Dockerfile</strong></td><td>A text file with instructions to build an image.</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Volume</strong></td><td>A folder shared between your PC and the container. Data survives.</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Port</strong></td><td>A door. Users reach the app through a port.</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Registry</strong></td><td>A place to store images (like Docker Hub).</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Docker Hub</strong></td><td>A public registry where people share images.</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Section 5: Real Client Example -->
            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 rounded-4 mb-4 border-start border-4 border-warning section-card">
