                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-3"><span class="section-num">5</span> 🌍 Real Client Example: The Restaurant Menu</h3>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Client:</strong> A family restaurant in Hamilton, Ontario.
                        They want an online menu so customers can see dishes and prices.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Problem:</strong> The developer built the app on their
                        laptop — works perfectly. But on the server, it crashes. Server
                        has .NET 6, laptop has .NET 8. Same code, different result.
                        The classic <em>"works on my machine"</em> problem.
                    </p>

                    <div class="step-box">
                        <strong>Step 1: Write a Dockerfile</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0 small mt-1">"Use .NET 8. Copy the app. Build. Run." Now we have a recipe.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-box">
                        <strong>Step 2: Build the image</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0 small mt-1">Run <code>docker build -t menu-app .</code></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-box">
                        <strong>Step 3: Run the container</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0 small mt-1">Run <code>docker run -p 8080:80 menu-app</code> — starts in seconds.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="result-box">
                        <strong>🎉 The Result</strong>
                        <ul class="mb-0 small mt-1">
